Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Arena Intelligence QA — D1..D7 audit of all 21 engines (P0-EI-01..21) on 66928be.
All changes reproduce a breach first, then close it; full regression green.

Engine-side No-Fabrication fixes (empty/null data must never yield plausible metrics):
- school-intelligence-center (EI-09): avg_gpa 15.0 / calendar 95.0 / chronic 5.0 /
  resolution 100.0 / active_teachers min-1 / parent PEI 78.5 fabrications -> null +
  explicit data_quality block; health index skips missing dims (weight renormalization),
  NO_DATA status; district aggregation no longer counts no-data schools as HEALTHY
  nor averages fabricated 90/5 rates.
- school-health-dashboard (EI-05): component defaults (100/85/85/80/…/90/5) removed;
  dimensions null when unfed, weighted score over available dims only, health_level
  NO_DATA when nothing measured, data_coverage block added.
- quality-governance (EI-11): per-pillar defaults 80/85/85/80/80 removed; pillar
  score null + status NO_DATA without real data; overall index over available pillars
  only; district mean excludes no-data schools (was ?? 75.0).
- parent-360 (EI-06): attendance_rate 100% fabrication on zero sessions -> null +
  NO_DATA status + recorded_sessions_count.
- intervention-case-management (EI-08): resolution_rate 0-with-no-cases and
  effective_interventions_ratio 1.0-with-no-evaluations -> null + data_quality.
- student-timeline (EI-02): invalid/missing timestamps no longer fabricated as
  epoch 1970; events excluded + counted in data_quality.

HTTP-path fixes (server/routes/analytics.js):
- NaN fail-open closed: school_id/region_id now validated as positive integers in all
  13 analytics handlers (baseline: EI-18/19/20/21 returned 200 snapshots for
  school_id=abc under superadmin; now 400).
- EI-13: hardcoded snapshot (88.0/80.0/14.5/14.5/0.08) replaced with metrics computed
  from real store rows; NO_DATA short-circuit instead of fabricated recommendations.
- EI-14: fabricated ACT-DEFAULT-01 history and constant delta_metrics removed.
- EI-15: fabricated ACT-DEF-01 action and constant 92/98/95 (and regional 88/95)
  removed; unmeasured approval_time null.
- EI-16..21: explicit data_provenance=SYNTHETIC_BASELINE markers (engines have no real
  data pipeline; deep fix needs Tech Lead / product decision - left OPEN).
- Live generated_at timestamps injected (stale constant 2026-09-18 on HTTP path).

Tests:
- tests/arena-iqa-engine-battery.js: 21-engine D1..D7 battery (249 checks).
- tests/api/school-regional-intelligence.test.js: live HTTP coverage for EI-09/10
  endpoints (auth, tenant isolation, invalid params, no-data masking); registered
  in tests/api/runner.js.

Regression: tests/run.js 35/35, smoke 547/547, semantic-layer 33/33,
tests/api 31/31, battery 249/0.
